        "$\\begin{bmatrix}-5&3\\\\2&1\\end{bmatrix}$",
        "$\\begin{bmatrix}5&-2\\\\3&-1\\end{bmatrix}$",
        "$\\begin{bmatrix}5&3\\\\-2&-1\\end{bmatrix}$"
