        "$\\operatorname{adj}(AB)=(\\operatorname{adj}A)(\\operatorname{adj}B)$"
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "solution": "$\\operatorname{adj}(AB)=(\\operatorname{adj}B)(\\operatorname{adj}A)$ — the order reverses — so (d) is not true."
