      "topic": "Rank of a matrix",
      "source": "TN HSE Mar 2023",
      "type": "mcq",
      "marks": 1,
      "q": "A square matrix $A$ of order $n$ has inverse if and only if :",
      "options": [
        "$\\rho(A)>n$",
        "$\\rho(A)=n$",
        "$\\rho(A)\\ne n$",
        "$\\rho(A)<n$"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "solution": "$A^{-1}$ exists iff $|A|\\ne0$, i.e. iff $A$ has full rank: $\\rho(A)=n$."
    },
    {
      "id": "tn12m-mat-23q13",
      "chapter": "Applications of Matrices and Determinants",
      "topic": "Properties of adjoint",
      "source": "TN HSE Mar 2023",
      "type": "mcq",
      "marks": 1,
      "q": "$|\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj}A)|=|A|^{16}$, then the order of the square matrix $A$ is :",
      "options": [
        "2",
        "3",
        "5",
        "4"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "solution": "$|\\operatorname{adj}(\\operatorname{adj}A)|=|A|^{(n-1)^2}=|A|^{16}$, so $n-1=4$, $n=5$."
    },
