      "tolerance": 0,
      "solution": "$R_2=2R_1$, so the determinant is $0$ and the rank is below 3. The minor $\\begin{vmatrix}1&2\\\\1&1\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\ne0$, so the rank is **2**."
